id%22%3A%22u4ba30ccb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"6fef80d1\" id=\"6fef80d1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc9477a4e\" id=\"uc9477a4e\">步骤一：理论估算模型显存</span></strong></h4><ol list=\"u43b78c91\"><li fid=\"u44bbaf76\" data-lake-id=\"udc3227ea\" id=\"udc3227ea\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u44491f33\" id=\"u44491f33\">模型参数量计算</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ufd15d6a8\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u4c3399c7\" data-lake-id=\"ud5fe654a\" id=\"ud5fe654a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b6f2465\" id=\"u8b6f2465\">公式：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6b3bbba8\" id=\"u6b3bbba8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4aef4c4\" id=\"ud4aef4c4\">参数量 = 卷积核数量 × 卷积核大小 × 输入通道数 × 输出通道数</span></code></li><li fid=\"u4c3399c7\" data-lake-id=\"ua2705219\" id=\"ua2705219\"><span data-lake-id=\"u49e6c969\" id=\"u49e6c969\">示例（以 3D U-Net 为例）： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E6%9F%90%E5%B1%82%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%9A3%C3%973%C3%973%20%E5%8D%B7%E7%A7%AF%E6%A0%B8%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%2016%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E9%80%9A%E9%81%93%2032%20%20%5Cnparam_size%20%3D%203%20*%203%20*%203%20*%2016%20*%2032%20%20%23%208%2C294%20bytes%20%E2%89%88%208KB%20%20%5Cntotal_params%20%3D%20sum(p.numel()%20for%20p%20in%20model.parameters())%20%20%23%20%E6%80%BB%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%20%20%5Cnmodel_memory%20%3D%20total_params%20*%204%20%20%23%20float32%20%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%8D%A0%204B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JQ9xQ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"ufd15d6a8\" start=\"3\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u4c3399c7\" data-lake-id=\"ud708b561\" id=\"ud708b561\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30e39345\" id=\"u30e39345\">结果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e24f8c7\" id=\"u0e24f8c7\">：3D U-Net 参数量约 1.2 亿，显存占用 ≈ 480MB</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u43b78c91\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u44bbaf76\" data-lake-id=\"ub0b87d85\" id=\"ub0b87d85\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uecc6a972\" id=\"uecc6a972\">输入数据与中间结果</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ufa1fd122\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc5ce4dc7\" data-lake-id=\"u1b26f210\" id=\"u1b26f210\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39b4488f\" id=\"u39b4488f\">输入张量：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ueac9c408\" id=\"ueac9c408\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0f8695a\" id=\"ub0f8695a\">512×512×32×4</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf8f7918a\" id=\"uf8f7918a\">（batch=4，通道=1，高度=512，宽度=512） </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22input_memory%20%3D%20512%20*%20512%20*%2032%20*%204%20*%204%20%20%23%204B%2Ffloat32%20%E2%86%92%201%2C048%2C576%20KB%20%E2%89%88%201GB%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JUvGW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"ufa1fd122\" start=\"2\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc5ce4dc7\" data-lake-id=\"u2d3aaf2d\" id=\"u2d3aaf2d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2853341a\" id=\"u2853341a\">中间特征图（以 4 层为例，每层输出 256×256×16）： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22feature_memory%20%3D%20sum(%5B256*256*16*4%20for%20_%20in%2